  sha256 is 0013edf6cdc3a48d69aed5d7db41cc6647cfd461d348f5e1d563ba85664143d1,
  unchanged. in_scope is decided by the allowlist alone, so a row from outside
  the twelve roots would be kept with in_scope: false rather than dropped
  (AAP 0.6.4). None arose here: all 32 paths match the allowlist.

